  {
    "id": 1024004020040,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────１日、ダンスレッスン体験……ですか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "体験レッスンを子どもたちと一緒に受けて、\r\nその様子をWEB広告として使用するらしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "聞くまでもないですけど、\r\nそれって……まだ、請けてないですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ワンマンライブも控えてるし、\r\nにちかの無理のない範囲で考えてほしいって、思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020060,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────でも、請けてほしいって、ことですよね？\r\nそうやって聞いてくる、ってことは",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そう、だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "にちかが楽しめる……\r\n楽しいって思える仕事だって、俺は思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020070,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020080,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "そんな……\r\n楽しんでる場合じゃ、ないと思うんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020090,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────ワンマン、控えてるんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020100,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "もっかいスケジュール、\r\n一緒に確認した方がいいです？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────今のペースで練習を\r\n積み重ねていけば……大丈夫だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020110,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "はは、さすが敏腕！\r\n未来のことまでわかるんだー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_rebellion2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、俺個人の意見じゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "トレーナーさんも、言ってた\r\n今のにちかなら大丈夫だろうって、伝えてくれたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020120,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020130,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "────だとしても、\r\n難しいんじゃないんですかねー、実際",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020140,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "それともあれですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020150,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "シーズの『ちょっと上手くない方』ってキャラ、\r\nしっかり守った方がいいんですかねー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──────守る必要なんかないよ、そんなものは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020160,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────すまん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "生徒さんの中には、\r\nシーズのファンもたくさんいるって、仰ってた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "にちかが来てくれたら、\r\nきっと……すごく喜ぶ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020170,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020180,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "いいんですかね、私で\r\nガッカリ、させちゃわないですかね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102400402/1024004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことあるわけない\r\nにちかを、ご指名いただいたんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1024004020190,
